<title>UK: Toyota Auto Receivables sets asset-backed bond.</title>
<headline>Toyota Auto Receivables sets asset-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Auto Receivables Grantor Trust 97-A has issued a $755 million three-tranche asset-backed bond, lead manager Lehman Brothers said.</p>
<p>The deal will be priced later. Class A notes total $723 million and will be priced to yield 31 basis points over one-month Libor. </p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS A</p>
<p> AMT    $723 MLN	COUPON     **	  LEGAL MAT   15.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    17.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  18.50 BP  REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+31 BP</p>
<p> MODDY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   AVE LIFE   1.3 YRS</p>
<p> MAN &amp; UND  6 BP	SELL CONC  12.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS B</p>
<p> AMT    $21 MLN	 COUPON     **	  LEGAL MAT   15.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    17.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+46 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A2/A	MAN &amp; UND  15 BP     SELL CONC   20 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS C</p>
<p> AMT    $11 MLN	 COUPON     **	  LEGAL MAT   15.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    17.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  45 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+65 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  BAA3/BBB  MAN &amp; UND  20 BP     SELL CONC   25 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX/HK    DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	JOINT LEAD MANAGER IS CSFB</p>
